  "title": "FRR 路由",
  "description": "Internal routes: iBGP (+BFD) over the Tinc mesh; external routes: eBGP over WireGuard/OpenVPN; OSPF only carries the Anycast pool. Only explicitly originated prefix sets are advertised; private LAN never leaves the internal network.",
